# Link checker exclusions (ADR-0022): one regular expression per line, each with its reason.
# Local development server, only up during `npm run dev`.
^https?://localhost
# Backlog templates (docs/backlog/_*.md) link as if copied into stories/: excluded by path in links.yml.
# Standards publishers that refuse automated clients such as lychee and WebFetch (HTTP 403,
# 2026-10-09); their pages are cited with that qualifier in docs/references.md.
^https://library\.iec\.ch/
^https://webstore\.ansi\.org/
^https://www\.iso\.org/
# GitLab merge request pages refuse automated clients (HTTP 403, 2026-10-11); the merge request
# exists (GitLab API, HTTP 200). Cited in docs/references.md (REF-INKSCAPE-SNAP).
^https://gitlab\.com/inkscape/inkscape/-/merge_requests/
# Adobe's live shapes tutorial answered HTTP 403 to lychee (2026-10-15), to the library's reader
# and to curl (2026-10-19); its text, read on 2026-10-12, is cited in docs/references.md
# (REF-ADOBE-LIVE-SHAPES). Adobe's help page on live shapes answers but lacks the text cited.
^https://www\.adobe\.com/learn/illustrator/web/live-shapes$
